Revision history for Data-Fenwick2D-Shared

0.01      2026-07-12
          - Initial release. Shared-memory 2-D Fenwick tree (binary indexed
            tree): a rows x cols grid of signed int64 cells with O(log rows *
            log cols) point update and rectangle-sum query (prefix / rect /
            point / total), shared across processes via a backing file, an
            anonymous mapping inherited across fork, or a memfd; guarded by a
            write-preferring futex rwlock with dead-process recovery.
